cartridge "SANTA'S SLEIGH RUN/PRESENTS AMY STUDIO/2026"

' SANTA'S SLEIGH RUN
' A Christmas game for the ColecoVision, written in Amy. Five stages, then round again, harder:
'   1  DELIVERY  fly Santa's sleigh over five houses and drop a gift down every chimney
'   2  FACTORY   catch the toys falling from the North Pole workshop chutes in Santa's sack
'   3  DEFENCE   throw snowballs at the coal goblins marching on the Pole
' Three lives (an extra one after every round).  All art is packed with ZX0 and unpacked to video
' memory when a stage begins.  Everything that matters stays in columns 2-29, inside the overscan.
' Music: "Jingle Bells" (public domain) and tunes written for the game.

' ---- DEBUG SHORTCUTS: remove the leading ' from a line to switch it on, then build -------------
'   define DBG_SKIP_TITLE     start straight in the game, no title screen
'   define DBG_STAGE_2        begin at stage 2, the toy factory  (DBG_STAGE_3: goblins, DBG_STAGE_4: ice wall, DBG_STAGE_5: sky dash)
'   define DBG_ROUND_2        begin at round 2: wind, crows, rank (DBG_ROUND_3, DBG_ROUND_4 are harder)
'   define DBG_LIVES_5        begin with five lives
'   define DBG_QUICK          tiny stages (1 house, 3 toys, 3 goblins, 5 bricks, a short flight) to see the clear screens fast
'   define DBG_GOD            lives are never lost

